map_pack verify: assets/maps/m21 -> 0 违规（schema/兼容/I1~I9 全过）
map_pack pack: m21 → dist/maps/m21.map-pack + dist/maps/m21.map-pack.zip
map_pack install: m21 → assets/maps/m21（board.json 已接线 + index.json 更新）
map_pack check: 0 漂移（21 个已装包 vs board.json；默认包 m01 vs 布局数据）
map_pack sync: 21 个已装包 map.json → board.json；默认包 m01 layout → scenes.json / manifest / strings
```
✅ I1~I9 全过 + pack/install/check/sync 全通。

